sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant DB
    Client->>API: POST /transfer
    API->>DB: Find recipient
    DB-->>API: Recipient
    API->>DB: Find source and balance
    DB-->>API: Source
    API->>DB: Debit source
    API->>DB: Credit recipient
    API->>DB: Insert transfer history
    API-->>Client: Response
    Note over API,DB: Current writes are not one transaction
